Import the C function malloc taking a size type, returning a pointer to void, from the header "stdlib.h".
Import the C function free taking a pointer to void, returning void, from the header "stdlib.h".
Structure packet:
    Field length as integer.
    Flexible field data as integer.
End structure.
Declare raw as pointer to void with value Call malloc with (Size of type structure packet plus 4 times Size of type integer) done.
Declare p as pointer to structure packet with value Convert raw to type pointer to structure packet.
Set member length of p to 4.
Set element at 0 in Member data of p to 5.
Set element at 3 in Member data of p to 9.
Say Member length of p.
Say Element at 0 in Member data of p plus Element at 3 in Member data of p.
Call free with raw done.
